# Drain Power has Bot2 activate Mana Confluence, paying its 1 life (a cost the activation pays, CR 602.2b: Bot2 goes to 19).
# Bot2 controls Horizon Stone: "If you would lose unspent mana, that mana becomes colorless instead" (CR 614.1a), so Bot2
# loses none of its mana - it keeps {C} - and Bot1 adds no mana: only the mana lost this way is added.

