Bot1.Battlefield.Island#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Drain Power.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mana Confluence.Activate(Color: Green)
? Bot1.Mana =
? Bot2.Mana = {C}

